# LSan (Leak Sanitizer) suppression file
# https://clang.llvm.org/docs/LeakSanitizer.html

# Vips creates a global PangoFontMap and never frees it.
# It's not a leak per se, but it will be reported by LSan.
# We don't use fontconfig directly, only via libvips,
# so it should be safe to suppress all leaks from libfontconfig completely.
leak:libfontconfig.so
